# Changelog

## [v0.2.0] - 2026-07-10

### Added
- Token scope validation (was announced in v0.1.0 but never implemented): before
  querying the MR the tool calls `GET /personal_access_tokens/self` and fails
  fast if the token lacks the `read_api` (or `api`) scope, or is invalid /
  revoked / expired. Token types that don't support the endpoint only produce
  a warning and processing continues.

### Changed
- Renamed the Go module from `linuxhelp.com.ua` to `github.com/wwwlde/ApproveGuard`.
- Migrated from the deprecated `github.com/xanzy/go-gitlab` to the official
  `gitlab.com/gitlab-org/api/client-go` (project/MR IDs are now `int64`).
- Aligned the Go version everywhere (go.mod / Dockerfile / CI / README): Go 1.24.
- Renamed `getProjectIDFromURL` to `getProjectPathFromURL` (it returns the project
  path, not an ID) and hardened it against URLs with an empty project path.
- `extractProtocolAndDomain` now rejects URLs without a scheme or host instead of
  returning a malformed base URL like `://`.
- Errors are wrapped with `%w` for proper error chains.
- Dockerfile: builder image `golang:1.24`, `alpine:3.21`, cached `go mod download`
  layer, build version via `ARG VERSION` instead of a hardcoded `0.0.1`,
  SPDX license label `GPL-3.0-only`.
- Release workflow: `actions/checkout@v4`, `actions/setup-go@v5`
  (`go-version-file: go.mod`), `softprops/action-gh-release@v2`; added a
  vet + test job before building; added a `darwin/arm64` (Apple Silicon) build.

### Fixed
- README: stale `BlockMaster` name in the sample `--help` output; documented
  Go 1.24 and running tests.
- Release workflow: grant `contents: write` permission and fall back to the
  default `github.token` when the `RELEASE_GITHUB_TOKEN` secret is not set —
  without it the release job failed to create the GitHub Release
  ("Resource not accessible by integration").

## [v0.1.0] - 2025-01-28

### Added
- Added context with timeout for all GitLab API requests.
- Added HTTP client timeout for GitLab API calls.
- Added validation for `upvotesThreshold` and `mergeRequestID` to ensure positive values.
- Added unit tests for `getProjectIDFromURL` and `extractProtocolAndDomain`.

### Fixed
- Fixed incorrect command name in `--help` output (changed from `BlockMaster` to `ApproveGuard`).
- Improved error messages for missing or invalid input parameters.
- Fixed potential panic when parsing invalid URLs.

### Improved
- Added default version (`dev`) if not set during build.
- Improved logging with more descriptive messages.
- Added token permission validation (checks if token has `read_api` access).

### Security
- Added timeout for HTTP requests to prevent hanging.

### Documentation
- Added detailed comments for Atlantis environment variables in `repos.yaml`.
- Updated README with instructions for running tests.
